{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/22163f786dde0c174d4908f3c5a31de6.avif?t=1760291432\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buggy is a cute <strong>bug-collection game</strong>. Play as Fenny to catch bugs around Critter Island, fill your collection book, customize your character, and hang out with friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CATCH THEM ALL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees, Isopods, Butterflies, Moths and more! There are\u00a0<strong>over 50 Bugs</strong>\u00a0you can catch across Critter Island. Complete your <strong>Insectarium</strong>, set bugs free to earn money, unlock customization and receive special rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1d3529aaf646908f2bc45ff2d77a126c.poster.avif?t=1760291432\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1d3529aaf646908f2bc45ff2d77a126c.webm?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1d3529aaf646908f2bc45ff2d77a126c.mp4?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER WITH YOUR FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buggy is a social space where you can meet new peeps, catch bugs together, goob around and explore Critter Island together.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1924db956914828e165a3c3c99468338.poster.avif?t=1760291432\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1924db956914828e165a3c3c99468338.webm?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/1924db956914828e165a3c3c99468338.mp4?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR BUG NET!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your strength and stamina, or upgrade your bug net with unique perks to become the legendary bug hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/6848076411faef3fee4762a1814d3373.poster.avif?t=1760291432\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/6848076411faef3fee4762a1814d3373.webm?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/6848076411faef3fee4762a1814d3373.mp4?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE FENNY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your personality with tons of different cosmetics and accessories! Be your own Fenny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/79ae23708576de8aaaacc1548726387f.poster.avif?t=1760291432\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315390/extras/79ae23708576de8aaaacc1548726387f.webm?t=1760291432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste